\"}]', '', '2026-09-01 13:53:37', '100', '2026-09-01 16:53:56', b'0', 1), (2, 'HR&招聘', '帮助HR快速实现人力资源', 'http://127.0.0.1:48089/admin-api/infra/file/4/get/20260901/HR-recruit-cover.png', 0, 20, '[{\"title\": \"公司愿景和使命\", \"content\": \"\\n<p>公司愿景和使命</p>\\n<h1 style=\\\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan;\\\">公司愿景</h1>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\">在这里描述公司的愿景</p>\\n<h1 style=\\\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan;\\\">公司使命</h1>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\">在这里描述公司的使命</p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\\n<h1 style=\\\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan;\\\">公司价值观</h1>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\">列出公司的价值观</p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\"}, {\"title\": \"新员工入职指南\", \"content\": \"\\n<p style=\\\"font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold;\\\">新员工入职指南</p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-pagination: widow-orphan;\\\">欢迎加入我们的大家庭！</p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-pagination: widow-orphan;\\\">初到新环境，你一定很想知道：如何在最短的时间内融入团队，尽快适应新工作？</p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-pagination: widow-orphan;\\\">在这里，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">HR </span>团队精心为你准备了入职<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">3</span>个月引导任务清单，需要你依次完成。帮助你对公司、团队和自己的工作有更深入的了解，更好的适应工作。在解锁任务的过程中，无论遇到任何问题和困难，请随时向<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\"> HR </span>提出，或向周围的小伙伴询问。</p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">Day 1</span></p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-left: 21.0pt; text-indent: -21.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">l<span style=\\\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\\\">&nbsp; </span></span></span>向你的团队介绍自己，主动认识每一位成员</p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-left: 21.0pt; text-indent: -21.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">l<span style=\\\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\\\">&nbsp; </span></span></span>找到行政同事，领取属于你的办公用品</p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-left: 21.0pt; text-indent: -21.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">l<span style=\\\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\\\">&nbsp; </span></span></span>登录考勤系统，并通知<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\"> HR </span>通过审核</p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-left: 21.0pt; text-indent: -21.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">l<span style=\\\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\\\">&nbsp; </span></span></span>和至少一位团队成员共进午餐</p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-left: 21.0pt; text-indent: -21.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">l<span style=\\\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\\\">&nbsp; </span></span></span>请身边的一位小伙伴邀请你进入公司微信群</p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">Week1</span></p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-left: 21.0pt; text-indent: -21.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">l<span style=\\\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\\\">&nbsp; </span></span></span>与自己的团队<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\"> Leader </span>明确工作内容，确定<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">3</span>个月工作目标</p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-left: 21.0pt; text-indent: -21.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">l<span style=\\\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\\\">&nbsp; </span></span></span>不要忘了签署聘任协议</p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-left: 21.0pt; text-indent: -21.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">l<span style=\\\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\\\">&nbsp; </span></span></span>在知识库里完成「公司通识」和所属部门通识课的培训</p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">Month1</span></p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-left: 21.0pt; text-indent: -21.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">l<span style=\\\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\\\">&nbsp; </span></span></span>参加过新人培训</p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-left: 21.0pt; text-indent: -21.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">l<span style=\\\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\\\">&nbsp; </span></span></span>认识团队的所有成员并了解他们的工作内容及工作风格</p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-left: 21.0pt; text-indent: -21.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">l<span style=\\\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\\\">&nbsp; </span></span></span>勾搭<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">5</span>个以上其他团队的成员，并和他们无障碍交流与协作</p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\"}, {\"title\": \"公司福利政策\", \"content\": \"\\n<p style=\\\"font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold;\\\">公司福利政策</p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: left; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"left\\\">福利项目</p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: left; mso-pagination: widow-orphan;\\\" align=\\\"left\\\">在这里写下福利项目的描述。</p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"text-align: left; mso-pagination: widow-orphan;\\\" align=\\\"left\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">+ </span>上传附件</p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"text-align: left; mso-pagination: widow-orphan;\\\" align=\\\"left\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: left; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-outline-level: 1;\\\" align=\\\"left\\\">福利项目</p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: left; mso-pagination: widow-orphan;\\\" align=\\\"left\\\">在这里写下福利项目的描述。</p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"text-align: left; mso-pagination: widow-orphan;\\\" align=\\\"left\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">+ </span>上传附件</p>\"}, {\"title\": \"团队 OKRs\", \"content\": \"\\n<p style=\\\"font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold;\\\">团队 OKRs</p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: left; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-outline-level: 2;\\\" align=\\\"left\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">O </span>目标<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\"> 1</span></p>\\n<ul type=\\\"disc\\\">\\n<li class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">KR1 </span></li>\\n<li class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">KR2 </span></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: left; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-outline-level: 2;\\\" align=\\\"left\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">O </span>目标<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\"> 2</span></p>\\n<ul type=\\\"disc\\\">\\n<li class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">KR1 </span></li>\\n<li class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">KR2 </span></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: left; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-outline-level: 2;\\\" align=\\\"left\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">O </span>目标<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\"> 3</span></p>\\n<ul type=\\\"disc\\\">\\n<li class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">KR1 </span></li>\\n<li class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">KR2 </span></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\"}, {\"title\": \"绩效回顾\", \"content\": \"\\n<p style=\\\"font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold;\\\">绩效回顾</p>\\n<p class=\\\"p1x2j\\\">这是你<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">2018</span>年年末的绩效回顾文档，请完成以下工作：</p>\\n<p class=\\\"li2ay\\\" style=\\\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">1.<span style=\\\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\\\">&nbsp; </span></span></span>完成自评内容</p>\\n<p class=\\\"li2ay\\\" style=\\\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">2.<span style=\\\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\\\">&nbsp; </span></span></span>在文档底部列出 <span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">3-5</span> 个同级评价者</p>\\n<p cla