 lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">1. </span>你觉得下属表现优异的项目有哪些</p>\\n<p class=\\\"p1x2j\\\">在这里回答</p>\\n<p><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">2. </span>你觉得下属今年有哪些项目可以做出改进</p>\\n<p class=\\\"p1x2j\\\">在这里回答</p>\\n<p><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">3. </span>描述你的下属明年需要达成的核心目标</p>\\n<p class=\\\"p1x2j\\\">在这里回答</p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\">同级评价者</p>\\n<p class=\\\"p1x2j\\\">列出<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">3-5</span>个同级评价者的名字</p>\\n<p class=\\\"li2ay\\\" style=\\\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&middot;<span style=\\\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span>名字<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\"> - </span>部门</p>\\n<p class=\\\"li2ay\\\" style=\\\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&middot;<span style=\\\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span>名字<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\"> - </span>部门</p>\\n<p class=\\\"li2ay\\\" style=\\\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&middot;<span style=\\\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span>名字<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\"> - </span>部门</p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\"}, {\"title\": \"候选人沟通记录\", \"content\": \"\\n<p style=\\\"font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold;\\\">候选人沟通记录</p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-